      "side": 0,
      "message": "Is there a way to tell IWYU to always include SkTypes.h, assuming nothing else is included? This removal is technically safe, but as a rule we\u0027ve always wanted to keep this for headers that have nothing else included. If anyone adds any logic to the header that depends on our preprocessor macros, this becomes a bug - without SkTypes.h, none of the preprocessor logic that deduces and sets those values gets encountered.",
      "revId": "6c78b8d3aefb4f2759847715f6bb4c898cee3124",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
