        "id": 5395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-25T15:36:12Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "There are two options here. \nOne: We add // IWYU pragma: export to our SkTypes include when it\u0027s the only include [1]\nTwo: We add --keep \"include/core/SkType.h\" to our invocation of the IWYU binary and then it never tries to take it away.\n\nWhich do you prefer?\n\n[1] https://github.com/include-what-you-use/include-what-you-use/blob/master/docs/IWYUPragmas.md#iwyu-pragma-keep",
      "parentUuid": "8a11f833_09ea8ccf",
      "revId": "6c78b8d3aefb4f2759847715f6bb4c898cee3124",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
